sults…).\",\n  \"gl_t_BUSQUEDA\": \"Results of the search across the whole database.\",\n  \"gl_t_MAPA HUECOS\": \"Parts of the thesis with little literature.\",\n  \"gl_t_AUTORES CLAVE\": \"Authors you want to follow (AUTOR column; CONFIRMADO = Sí when the person is correct).\",\n  \"gl_t_CONGRESOS\": \"Conferences and deadlines (FECHA_LIMITE = deadline, ESTADO = status of your participation).\",\n  \"gl_t_FUENTES PRIMARIAS\": \"Primary-source documents for your cases (reports, regulations); VIGILAR = alert on changes.\",\n  \"gl_c_1\": \"Title of the publication.\",\n  \"gl_c_2\": \"Authors.\",\n  \"gl_c_3\": \"Year of publication.\",\n  \"gl_c_4\": \"Journal or publisher.\",\n  \"gl_c_5\": \"Main topic (editable).\",\n  \"gl_c_6\": \"Relevance to your thesis, 0 to 5 (editable).\",\n  \"gl_c_7\": \"The AI’s confidence in its analysis.\",\n  \"gl_c_8\": \"One-sentence AI summary (editable).\",\n  \"gl_c_9\": \"Reading status: choose from the dropdown.\",\n  \"gl_c_10\": \"Is it already in your reference manager? (Sí/No = Yes/No)\",\n  \"gl_c_11\": \"Where it came from: daily new item or historical.\",\n  \"gl_c_12\": \"Link to the publication.\",\n  \"gl_hdr\": [\n   \"Identifier\",\n   \"DOI\",\n   \"Title\",\n   \"Authors\",\n   \"Year\",\n   \"Publication date\",\n   \"Journal or publisher\",\n   \"Document type\",\n   \"Language\",\n   \"Source\",\n   \"Link (URL)\",\n   \"Original abstract\",\n   \"AI-written summary\",\n   \"Main topic\",\n   \"Secondary topics\",\n   \"Relevance 0 to 5\",\n   \"Reason for the relevance\",\n   \"Link to the thesis\",\n   \"Reading status\",\n   \"Detection date\",\n   \"Review date\",\n   \"Already in Mendeley\",\n   \"AI analysis level\",\n   \"AI confidence\",\n   \"Origin\",\n   \"Exported to Mendeley\",\n   \"Mendeley document ID\",\n   \"Date\",\n   \"Process\",\n   \"Result\",\n   \"New records\",\n   \"Errors\",\n   \"Details\",\n   \"Author\",\n   \"OpenAlex candidate\",\n   \"OpenAlex ID\",\n   \"Confirmed (Yes/No)\"