 \"Hutafuta katika hifadhidata <b>nzima</b>, si RADAR pekee.\",\n  \"bq_palabras\": \"Maneno\",\n  \"bq_ph\": \"utawala \\\"kufanya maamuzi\\\" -utalii\",\n  \"bq_ayuda\": \"Weka kifungu kamili kwenye alama za nukuu. Kwa - mwanzoni, huondolewa.\",\n  \"bq_debe\": \"Lazima iwe na\",\n  \"bq_todas\": \"Maneno yote\",\n  \"bq_alguna\": \"Angalau neno moja\",\n  \"bq_buscar_en\": \"Tafuta katika\",\n  \"bq_todo\": \"Yote (pamoja na abstract asili)\",\n  \"bq_rapido\": \"Kichwa, muhtasari, mada na waandishi\",\n  \"bq_minima\": \"Umuhimu wa chini\",\n  \"bq_cualquiera\": \"Yoyote\",\n  \"bq_n_o_mas\": \"{0} au zaidi\",\n  \"bq_solo5\": \"5 pekee\",\n  \"bq_estado\": \"Hali\",\n  \"bq_boton\": \"Tafuta\",\n  \"bq_buscando\": \"Inatafuta…\",\n  \"bq_err_vacio\": \"Andika neno moja angalau (herufi 2 au zaidi).\",\n  \"bq_err_sin_pub\": \"Bado hakuna machapisho ya kutafuta.\",\n  \"bq_sin_resultados\": \"Hakuna matokeo. Jaribu maneno machache au «Angalau neno moja».\",\n  \"bq_resultados\": \"Matokeo: {0}\",\n  \"bq_mostrados\": \" (bora {0} zinaonyeshwa)\",\n  \"bq_mira\": \". Tazama kichupo cha BUSQUEDA.\",\n  \"bq_h_busqueda\": \"Utafutaji: {0}\",\n  \"bq_h_resultados\": \"Matokeo: {0}. Bofya kichwa ili kufungua chapisho.\",\n  \"bq_cab\": [\n    \"Chapisho\",\n    \"Mahali pa mlinganisho\",\n    \"Umuhimu\",\n    \"Hali\",\n    \"Mwaka\",\n    \"Waandishi\",\n    \"Muhtasari\"\n  ],\n  \"bq_f_TITULO\": \"kichwa\",\n  \"bq_f_TEMATICA_PRINCIPAL\": \"mada\",\n  \"bq_f_TEMATICAS_SECUNDARIAS\": \"mada ndogo\",\n  \"bq_f_RESUMEN_IA\": \"muhtasari wa AI\",\n  \"bq_f_JUSTIFICACION_RELEVANCIA\": \"sababu\",\n  \"bq_f_AUTORES\": \"waandishi\",\n  \"bq_f_REVISTA_EDITORIAL\": \"jarida\",\n  \"bq_f_ABSTRACT_ORIGINAL\": \"abstract\",\n  \"zo_dialogo\": \"Unganisha na Zotero\",\n  \"zo_intro\": \"Tengeneza ufunguo kwenye <b>zotero.org/settings/keys</b> (kitufe «Create new private key»). Weka tiki kwenye <b>Allow library access</b> na <b>Allow write access</b>, hifadhi na unakili ufungu